{"2206860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Unforeseen Resurrection - Otome Isekai RPG", "steam_appid": 2206860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[CONTENT WARNING]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >! Contains some scary scenes !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the camera makes you dizzy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please press the middle mouse button to lock the camera's up/down movement, and/or</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if it's still making you dizzy, please go to &quot;Settings&quot; and uncheck the &quot;Camera Collider&quot; toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you stay safe, happy and healthy! ദ്ദി(˵ •̀ ᴗ - ˵ ) ✧</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of otome isekai</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character death &amp; rebirth via time travel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bullying (&amp; fighting back after rebirth! &gt;:D )</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[WORK IN PROGRESS]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game and demo are in active development.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The screenshots show the current state of the features.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things are still subject to change, i.e. features can be added, removed, changed, etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[STORY] Otome isekai</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>'My boyfriend got dumped by his lover, then he dumped my body in the sewer.' </i>Muttered a woman in her head. It was the only memory she had. <br> <br>With her body feeling light, the woman opened her eyes, when-!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She found herself floating in a dark void, and then-!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game-like screen popped up in front of her face!<br><br><strong>&quot;</strong>I-I think I am...&quot; The woman sputtered with a dumbfounded look on her face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game-like screen: &quot;You Died. You have enough gold. Wanna go back in time?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;I-I'M IN A GAME!!!&quot; </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAMEPLAY]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an otome game with gameplay. Below are the features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[PLANNED but UNCONFIRMED FEATURES]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Farming - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer - very very resource and time heavy, uncertain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Small Open World - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dress Up - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dating Sim / Life Sim - most mechanics implemented in prototype, needs more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hack and Slash - Might turn it into something less violent, like in Sailor Moon, the &quot;attack&quot; save people-turned-monsters instead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose Your Own Adventure - most mechanics implemented in prototype, needs more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Female Protagonist - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character Customization (with limits) - implemented in prototype with sample clothes, needs more clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pet - implemented something, but didn't include in prototype. Might need a better implementation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAME PLATFORMS]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Windows: This is the initial platform during the development</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[CONTENT WARNING]</strong></h2><