 Wanna go back in time?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;I-I'M IN A GAME!!!&quot; </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAMEPLAY]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an otome game with gameplay. Below are the features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[PLANNED but UNCONFIRMED FEATURES]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Farming - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiplayer - very very resource and time heavy, uncertain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Small Open World - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dress Up - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dating Sim / Life Sim - most mechanics implemented in prototype, needs more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hack and Slash - Might turn it into something less violent, like in Sailor Moon, the &quot;attack&quot; save people-turned-monsters instead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose Your Own Adventure - most mechanics implemented in prototype, needs more </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Female Protagonist - implemented in prototype</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Character Customization (with limits) - implemented in prototype with sample clothes, needs more clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pet - implemented something, but didn't include in prototype. Might need a better implementation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAME PLATFORMS]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Windows: This is the initial platform during the development</p>", "short_description": "An otome isekai RPG with dress up, farm sim, avatar customisation, building &amp; more!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206860/1b6c4faeaa45f7769c1ed40d2417ccf66a97ea71/header.jpg?t=1762916737", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akam